id: namekian-biology-third-effect
name: 3rd effect of Namekian Biology
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 4
kiCostGrowsPerBaseTier: 2
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
surge: true
surgeKind: healing
fromTrait: namekian-biology
fromEffect: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Namekian Biology's third effect, as a Maneuver: a Healing Surge for 1 Action and 4(bT) Ki, 2(bT) more each time after the first this Encounter.
text: >
  (3)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action and a Ki Point Cost of 4(bT) Ki Points, use a Healing Surge. Each time you use this effect after the first, increase the Ki Point Cost by 2(bT) for the remainder of the Combat Encounter.

---

# Majin Regeneration's third effect's shape: owned by every character, in the list only while Namekian Biology is had
# (`fromTrait`). Its price grows with each use this Encounter - `kiCostGrowsPerBaseTier`, counted by recordManeuverUse and
# read by baseKiCost (maneuvers.mjs).
